      "author": "copilot-pull-request-reviewer",
      "body": "This diagram hard-codes `@U18.virgin.com` in the opening summary, but the implemented flow generates the dummy domain from the `DummyEmailDomain` configuration key (defaulting to `U18.virgin.com`). Rewording avoids implying the domain is always hard-coded while still documenting the default.\n\nThis issue also appears on line 40 of the same file.",
      "decision": "valid",
      "resolutionComment": "Valid. Updated the opening summary and high-level behavior to state that the GUID N-format local part is combined with the configured DummyEmailDomain, whose default is U18.virgin.com. This matches Under18AccountRequestFactory, which reads DummyEmailDomain via ConfigReader.Try with U18.virgin.com as the fallback. The diagram remains InProgress, so no status catalog changes were required."
    }
  ],
